Z||000007||1FST2M6||04-20-2001||02:22 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/loudyno.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/loudyno.jpg</A>   Lou diaz's dyno numbers... don't buy a Spiral Max  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> .. an MSD 6A, NGK ur5 plugs, Accel ICM, and real injectors.. not the stock units.. you'll under fuel the crap out of it if your running headers on that and larger displacement. uum a larger Throttle body, the headers.. the Long tube units from <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A>  will do the trick for your larger motor... my car choked but you've got the displacement to warrant the higher flow. <A HREF="http://www.dynojet.com" TARGET=_blank>www.dynojet.com</A>  find a dyno near you and dyno your car NOW!! for a good before and after.. slow and crappy.. even if it's barely running... on 5cyl. if you've been driving it like that for 6 months even better.. your used to it now..  see what your paying for..  ||||reg||1
Z||000008||Dave Gunsul||04-20-2001||08:28 PM||||I bolted on Darrel Morse's bored out t-body<BR>on my 2.8 and noticed a nice difference every<BR>where, so it does work. Prob. with mods are<BR>that an engines a system and each mod, if done right, will compliment each other.<BR>In other words, if you bolt on a bored out t-body and nothing else you won't notice as much as someone that has other mods that will<BR>compliment this latest mod. <P>I forgot to say that you should probably get<BR>an adj. reg. too.<BR>BTW Bam, I'm guessing that Bob talked you into the 3.4?<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
Z||000009||Dave Gunsul||04-20-2001||08:38 PM||||I have a bored out t-body and can tell you<BR>that it made a nice difference.<BR>Can't wait to see how it will work on my new<BR>engine.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Prob. with mods that some people<BR>don't understand is; most mods, if done correctly, will compliment each other.<BR>In other words, someone who bolts on a bored<BR>out t-body with no other mods won't gain as much as someone who has other mods as well.<P>I forgot to mention before that I would suggest an adj. reg. too.<BR>BTW Bam, I'm guessing that Bob talked you into the 3.4? He's a good guy isn't he?<BR>Prob. talked your ear off too. ;-)<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
